                    </GetScriptBlock>
        <SetScriptBlock>
                        &lt;#
.SYNOPSIS
    Sets the Wave's CreationDate
.DESCRIPTION
    Sets the Wave's CreationDate metadata.
.NOTES
    Wave Metadata is stored in an optional `LIST` chunk.

    CreationDate metadata is stored
    with the four letter word key: `ICRD`
